{"t":{"t":10,"i":0,"p":{"k":["result","context"],"v":[{"t":10,"i":1,"p":{"k":["type","title","description","props"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"openapi"},{"t":1,"s":"Get a mandate and check its integrity"},{"t":1,"s":"The mandate, its status, the search it permits, and a fresh check of its digest, signature and event chain."},{"t":10,"i":2,"p":{"k":["payload","document","operations","showDescription"],"v":[{"t":10,"i":3,"p":{"k":["bundled","proxyUrl"],"v":[{"t":10,"i":4,"p":{"k":["openapi","info","servers","security","tags","paths","components"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"3.2.0"},{"t":10,"i":5,"p":{"k":["title","version","description","contact","license","x-server-configuration"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Undo API"},{"t":1,"s":"1.0.0"},{"t":1,"s":"Ctrl+Z for AI agent purchases, built on PayPal.\\n\\nUndo sits between a shopping agent and PayPal. A shopper signs a mandate (what the agent may buy, for how much)\\nwith a key that never leaves their device. The agent shops inside it, PayPal only **authorizes** the money, and\\nan undo window opens. Pressing Undo runs a fault check and routes the money: a free void inside the window, or a\\nrefund, a merchant claim or a return after capture. When the agent was at fault, its operator pays the merchant\\nback through PayPal Payouts. Every step is written to a hash-chained event log anyone can verify.\\n\\n**Signing.** Mandates and undo requests are signed with Ed25519 by the shopper's device key. The API never\\nsigns for a shopper. The exact strings to sign are given with each operation.\\n\\n**Sandbox.** This deployment runs on the PayPal sandbox; no real money moves. Costly endpoints are rate limited\\nper visitor and answer `429` with a `Retry-After` header when the limit or the free-tier budget is reached.\\n\\n**Agents.** Third-party agents usually connect over MCP (Streamable HTTP at `/api/mcp`, JSON-RPC, not described\\nhere). This document covers the HTTP API that the web app, agents and merchants call directly.\\n"},{"t":10,"i":6,"p":{"k":["name","url"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Undo"},{"t":1,"s":"https://undo-1c56.onrender.com"}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":7,"p":{"k":["name","url"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"MIT"},{"t":1,"s":"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":8,"p":{"k":["default-environment","default-server","environments"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Production"},{"t":1,"s":"Default"},{"t":9,"i":9,"a":[{"t":10,"i":10,"p":{"k":["name","servers","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Production"},{"t":9,"i":11,"a":[{"t":10,"i":12,"p":{"k":["name","url","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Default"},{"t":1,"s":"https://undo-1c56.onrender.com"},{"t":1,"s":"Undo's API on Render."}]},"o":0}],"o":0},{"t":1,"s":"The live sandbox deployment. PayPal sandbox only; no real money moves."}]},"o":0}],"o":0}]},"o":0}]},"o":0},{"t":9,"i":13,"a":[{"t":10,"i":14,"p":{"k":["url","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"https://undo-1c56.onrender.com"},{"t":1,"s":"Live sandbox deployment"}]},"o":0}],"o":0},{"t":9,"i":15,"a":[],"o":0},{"t":9,"i":16,"a":[{"t":10,"i":17,"p":{"k":["name","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Products"},{"t":1,"s":"Live product catalog search and detail, resolved to an exact variant."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":18,"p":{"k":["name","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Mandates"},{"t":1,"s":"Drafting, preparing, signing and reading shopper-signed intent mandates."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":19,"p":{"k":["name","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Mandate requests"},{"t":1,"s":"The shopper's side of a mandate an outside agent asked for."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":20,"p":{"k":["name","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Shopping"},{"t":1,"s":"Let Undo's agent shop inside a mandate and open a PayPal checkout that only authorizes the money."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":21,"p":{"k":["name","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Orders"},{"t":1,"s":"Purchases, their undo windows, the Undo button, and the evidence to verify them."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":22,"p":{"k":["name","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"Merchant"},{"t":1,"s":"The store's view. Sandbox demo store; merchant sign-in 